re an electrically nonconductive medium is essential or desirable. Where the clean environment and the hazard obstructions require the use of a gaseous agent. It is an ideal replacement agent for Halon 1301 alternative. \u0007 Telecommunication facilities \u0007 Electrical and Electronics hazard areas \u0007 Data Centers \u0007 Control Rooms \u0007 Museums / Archives \u0007 Military Installations \u0007 Libraries \u0007 Medical facilities PRESSURE REGULATOR TECHNOLOGY Pressure Regulators modulate the discharge pressure to a constant 40-60 Bar which still delivers the design c (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/inert-gas.jpg", "specifications": [{"label":"Chemical Name","value":"Ar (Argon)"},{"label":"Molecular Weight","value":"39.9"},{"label":"Boiling Point at 1.013 Bar","value":"-185.9�C"},{"label":"Critical Pressure","value":"49 Bar"},{"label":"Critical Temperature","value":"-122.3�C"},{"label":"Design Concentration for Class A Fire (NFPA)","value":"38.7%"},{"label":"Flooding Factor for Class A Fire (NFPA)","value":"0.481 m3/ m3"},{"label":"NOAEL","value":"43%"},{"label":"LOAEL","value":"53%"}], "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Inert Gas System Component"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/30_catelogue.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "inert", "gas", "system", "component" ] }, { "id": "ptel-foam-suppression-system", "slug": "foam-suppression-system", "name": "Foam Suppression System", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-suppression-systems", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Foam Suppression System (as listed by source).", "description": "Fire suppression foam comprises three parts: foam concentrate, water, and air. When mixed correctly, these parts form a homogeneous foam blanket that extinguishes flames by the combined cooling mechanisms, separating the flame source from the product surface, suppressing vapors, and smothering. This makes foam suppression systems an effective option for protecting flammable and combustible liquids. NAFFCO Pre-piped Vertical Bladder Tank is a complete self-contained proportioning system consisting of a bladder tank, ratio controller, and assembled piping. It is designed to inject foam concentrate into the water supply of a fire protection system and automatically proportions over a wide range of flow and pressures without the use of external power supply. NAFFCO Pre-piped Vertical Bladder Tank utilize water supply to pressurize the bladder and force the foam concentrate into the ratio controller. Once the system is in operation, water supply simultaneously feeds the bladder tank and ratio controller. The water applied to the outside surface of the bladder will subsequently displace the foam concentrate contained inside the bladder through the foam outlet pipe and into the metering o (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/foam-suppression-system.png", "specifications": [{"label":"Tank Shell","value":"Carbon Steel, SA 516 Gr.70."},{"label":"Bladder","value":"Vinyl Based Polymer"},{"label":"Pressure Relief Valve (Optional)","value":"Brass Construction with Set Pressure @ 15 bar"},{"label":"Internal Piping","value":"Perforated PVC, sch. 80,"},{"label":"Flanges","value":"ASTM A105, Class 150"},{"label":"Water Pipe","value":"Carbon Steel. sch. 40."},{"label":"Foam Pipes","value":"Stainless Steel. sch. 40."},{"label":"Vent/Drain/NRV Valves","value":"Brass/Bronze."},{"label":"Sight Glass Valve","value":"Sight Gauge with Shut O? & Drain Valve"},{"label":"Painting External","value":"Zinc Rich Primer with Red Enamel Finish"},{"label":"Painting Internal","value":"Zinc Rich Primer with Coal Tar Epoxy Paint"}], "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Foam Suppression System"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/31_catelogue.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "foam", "suppression", "system" ] }, { "id": "ptel-powder-based-ext", "slug": "powder-based-ext", "name": "Powder Based Extinguishing Component", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-extinguishers", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Powder Based Extinguishing Component (as listed by source).", "description": "Powder extinguishers contain a fine powder that forms a layer over the flames and smothers them. Our Fire Suppression System is a pre-engineered, cartridge-operated dry chemical system with either a fixed nozzle distribution network or with hand hose line system. The system is capable of automatic detection and when a fire is detected, the system is actuated either manually or automatically, operating the Cartridge cylinder valve. This operation pressurizes and fluidizes the dry chemical extinguishing agent in the tank, ruptures the burst disc when the required pressure is reached, and propels the dry chemical through network of distribution hose line system (manually operated) or through fixed nozzles and into the protected areas, suppressing the fire. We Supply NAFFCO made & Chinese Extinguishers. (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/powder-based-ext.png", "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Powder Based Extinguishing Component"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/32_catelogue.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "powder", "based", "extinguishing", "component" ] }, { "id": "ptel-wet-chemical-fire-suppression", "slug": "wet-chemical-fire-suppression", "name": "Wet Chemical Fire Suppression", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-suppression-systems", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Wet Chemical Fire Suppression (as listed by source).", "description": "KITCHEN MISTER - RESTAURANT FIRE SUPPRESSION SYSTEM Open flames, red-hot cooking surfaces, and a heavily greaseladen environment combine to make the modern commercial kitchen a potentially dangerous fire hazard. Kitchen fires spread quickly and have proven to be very difficult to extinguish, making them the leading cause of structural fire damage. Protecting the modern commercial kitchen from the everpresent danger of cooking oil & grease fires is the reason we developed. The NAFFCO Kitchen MisterSystem. Utilizing state of the art misting technology, the Kitchen Mister System has proven to be the most effective fixed kitchen fire extinguishing system ever developed, extinguishing potentially deadly kitchen fires fast, before they can spread. That's why the Kitchen Mister System is quickly becoming the preferred choice of fire protection professionals throughout the world. (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/wet-chemical-fire-suppression.jpg", "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Wet Chemical Fire Suppression"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Certificate","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/33_certificate.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "wet", "chemical", "fire", "suppression" ] }, { "id": "ptel-kf-56-upright-pendent-recessed-pendent", "slug": "kf-56-upright-pendent-recessed-pendent", "name": "Sprinkler K5.6 – Upright, Pendent & Recessed Pendent", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-sprinkler-systems", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Sprinkler K5.6 – Upright, Pendent & Recessed Pendent (as listed by source).", "description": "MODEL: SD1010 (Pendent), SD1015SR (Upright), SD1030, SD1032 Axis Safety provides upright, pendent-type sprinkler heads. A fire sprinkler or sprinkler head 