ct/conventional-sprinkler.jpg", "specifications": [{"label":"SPRINKLER IDENTIFICATION NUMBER","value":"Standard SD1025 (bulb 5mm), Quick Response SD1026 (bulb 3mm)"},{"label":"STYLE","value":"Conventional Sprinkler"},{"label":"FINISH","value":"Natural/Chrome"},{"label":"K FACTOR","value":"5.6gpm/psi�. (80lpm/bar�)"},{"label":"RESPONSE TIME INDEX (RTI)","value":"Standard 50 (m.s)�, Quick Response 30 (m.s)�"},{"label":"NOMINAL THREAD SIZE","value":"�\"NPT(15mm)"},{"label":"ORIFICE SIZE","value":"13mm"},{"label":"MAX. WORKING PRESSURE","value":"175PSI(1200kPa)"},{"label":"FACTORY HYDROSTATIC TEST","value":"100%@500PSI(3450 kPa)"},{"label":"MIN. OPERATION PRESSURE","value":"7 PSI(48 kPa)"}], "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Conventional Sprinkler"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Certificate","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/68_certificate.pdf"},{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/68_catelogue.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "conventional", "sprinkler" ] }, { "id": "ptel-y-strainer", "slug": "y-strainer", "name": "Y Strainer", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-protection-valves", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Y Strainer (as listed by source).", "description": "MODEL: SD-YS300FF-D Y-Strainers are devices for mechanically removing unwanted solids from liquid/gas/pipeline. FEATURES Working pressure: 300 psi Connection ends: Flange to ASME B16.1 Class 125 Temperature range: 0�C to 80�C Rubber Gasket-10�C to 350�C Graphite Gasket Coating: Fusion bonded epoxy coating internally and externally in accordance with ANSI/AWWA C550 Y-strainers are mechanical filtration devices used in pipelines to remove solid particles from liquids or gases. In various industries, including oil and gas, chemical processing, and HVAC systems, Y-strainers are commonly used because of their Y-shaped configuration. Here are the key features and functions of a Y-strainer: Filtration: Y-strainers are primarily made to catch and get rid of solid pollutants like rust, dirt, scale, and other foreign objects from the fluid or gas stream. They aid in guarding against damage or clogging brought on by these particles, which could affect downstream machinery and components including pumps, valves, and meters. Y-Shaped Design: A Y-shaped body with an inlet and an outlet makes up a Y-strainer. Solid particles are captured as the fluid or gas passes past the Y-shaped screen or mesh (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/y-strainer.png", "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Y Strainer"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Certificate","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/79_certificate.pdf"},{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/79_catelogue.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "y", "strainer" ] }, { "id": "ptel-os-y-gate-valve", "slug": "os-y-gate-valve", "name": "OS&Y Gate Valve", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-protection-valves", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "OS&Y Gate Valve (as listed by source).", "description": "Available Model: SD-OSY175GV-D, SD-OSY200FF-D, SD-OSY250FF-D, SD-OSY300FF-D According to NFPA A listed outside screw and yoke (OS&Y) gate valve shall be installed in the suction pipe. (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/os-y-gate-valve.png", "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["OS&Y Gate Valve"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/os-y-gate-valve-catalogue-pdf.pdf"},{"label":"Certificate","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/80_certificate.pdf"},{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/1772509038-os-y-gate-valve-catalogue-pdf.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "os", "y", "gate", "valve" ] }, { "id": "ptel-check-valve-nrv", "slug": "check-valve-nrv", "name": "Check Valve (NRV)", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-protection-valves", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Check Valve (NRV) (as listed by source).", "description": "Available Models: SD-NRV200FF-D / SD-NRV300FF-D Check valve or Non Return Valve allow fluid to flow in one direction only. Large fire protection systems sometimes experience severe water hammer caused by backflow when the automatic control shuts down the fire pump. Where conditions can be expected to cause objectionable water hammer, a listed anti water-hammer check valve should be installed in the discharge line of the fire pump. According to NFPA20, 4.15.6* - A listed check valve or backflow preventer shall be installed in the pump discharge assembly. (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/check-valve-nrv.png", "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Check Valve (NRV)"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Certificate","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/82_certificate.pdf"},{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/82_catelogue.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "check", "valve", "nrv" ] }, { "id": "ptel-flexible-rubber-expansion-joint", "slug": "flexible-rubber-expansion-joint", "name": "Flexible Rubber Expansion Joint", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-protection-valves", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Flexible Rubber Expansion Joint (as listed by source).", "description": "An Expansion joint alternately known as Bellows, is shaped like sealed springs required to contain the fluid pressure. It is available in stainless steel and rubber material. According to NFPA A device used to connect the ,shafts or other torque-transmitting components from a driver to the pump, and that permits minor angular and parallel misalignment as restricted by both the pump and coupling manufacturers. Material Specification: Main Body: Polarized Rubber Lining: Nylon Color Fabric Frame: Hard Steel Wire Flange: Mild Steel (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/flexible-rubber-expansion-joint.png", "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Flexible Rubber Expansion Joint"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/85_catelogue.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "flexible", "rubber", "expansion", "joint" ] }, { "id": "ptel-waste-cone", "slug": "waste-cone", "name": "Waste Cone", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-protection-valves", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Waste Cone (as listed by source).", "description": "Waste cones are designed to provide quick-and-easy visual confirmation of proper water flow in fire protection systems. Available for Onshore and Offshore Applications Manufactured in Accordance with NFPA 20 Requirements Designed for use with UL/FM Approved Fire Pump Pressure Relief Valves (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/waste-cone.jpg", "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Waste Cone"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/86_catelogue.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "waste", "cone" ] }, { "id": "ptel-pressure-relief-valve", "slug": "pressure-relief-valve", "name": "Pressure Relief Valve", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-protection-valves", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Pressure Relief Valve (as listed by source).", "description": "MODEL: 2050B-4KG1 BRAND: CLA-VAL COO: SWITZERLAND Pressure Relief Valve is designed to maintain constant upstream pressure within close limits. In operation, the valve is actuated by line pressure through a pilot control system, opening fast to maintain steady line pressure but closing gradually to prevent surges. In addition to surge relief, this valve can be used for pressure relief, pressure sustaining, back pressure or unloading functions in a by-pass system. At pump start, Cla-Val Relief Valve modulates to relieve excess pump capacity, maintaining positive system pressure at the pump discharge. When fire demand slows or ceases, Cla-Val Model 50B-4KG-1 opens, diverting entire pump output to discharge, allowing fire pump to be stopped without causing surging in the lines. (Please note that if the Model 50B-4KG-1 is to be used on a continuous duty basis to maintain fire-system pressure, suitable back pressure must be provided on the valve to prevent cavitation damage. Consult the factory for details.) (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/prv-pressure-relief-valve.jpg", "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Pressure Relief Valve"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Certificate","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/87_certificate.pdf"},{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/87_catelogue.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "pressure", "relief", "valve" ] }, { "id": "ptel-flow-meter", "slug": "flow-meter", "name": "Flow Meter", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-protection-valves", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Flow Meter (as listed by source).", "description": "Brand: Global Vision INC (GVI) Model: 1250-G Flow meter permits the convenience of testing net fire pump performance frequently without the cost of assembling a large group of personnel plus providing fire hoses and nozzles for each test. NAFFCO use flow meter of GLOBAL VISION as The new GVI digital gauge has a 4-20 ma output that can transmit flow data back to the controller, laptop or software. There is no bounce and is by far the easiest gauge to read. The GVI digital gauge is now FULLY FM APPROVED. Their readings were so good, we are conducting 3rd party flow testing that will prove our accuracy is closer to 0.5%. IN ADDITION: the design is so revolutionary, we applied for a design patent which was accepted by the patent office. This makes GVI the ONLY fire pump test meter supplier with a Patented venturi. GVI's new Design is FM Approved (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/flow-meter.jpg", "specifications": [{"label":"MATERIALS:","value":"MACHINED 1018 OR 1026 CARBON STEEL"},{"label":"VALVES:","value":"1/4\" BRASS BALL"},{"label":"BRASS FITTING:","value":"CA360"},{"label":"FLANGE OPT:","value":"150# ANSI B 16.5 300# ANSI B 16.5"},{"label":"ID TAG:","value":"POLYCARBONATE"}], "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Flow Meter"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Certificate","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/88_certificate.pdf"},{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/88_catelogue.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "flow", "meter" ] }, { "id": "ptel-tamper-supervisory-switch", "slug": "tamper-supervisory-switch", "name": "Tamper Supervisory Switch", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-protection-valves", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Tamper Supervisory Switch (as listed by source).", "description": "BRAND: POTTER MODEL: OSYSU-1 & OSYSU-2 The TAMPER SUPERVISORY SWITCH (OSYSU) is used to monitor the open position of an OS&Y (outside screw and yoke) type gate valve. This device is available in two models; the OSYSU-1, containing one set of SPDT (Form C) contacts and the OSYSU-2, containing two sets of SPDT (Form C) contacts. These switches mount conveniently to most OS&Y valves ranging in size from 2\" to 12\" (50mm to 300mm). They will mount on some valves as small as �\" (12,5mm). The cover is held in place by two tamper resistant screws that require a special tool to remove. The tool is furnished with each device. (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/tamper-supervisory-switch.jpg", "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Tamper Supervisory Switch"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/89_catelogue.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "tamper", "supervisory", "switch" ] }, { "id": "ptel-water-flow-switch", "slug": "water-flow-switch", "name": "Water Flow Switch", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-protection-valves", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Water Flow Switch (as listed by source).", "description": "MODEL: SD-WFD SERIES The Model SD-WFD is a vane type water flow switch for use on wet sprinkler system s. The water flow contains two single pole, double throw, snap action switches and an adjustable, instantly recycling pneumatic retard. Vane-type water flow detectors shall be installed on system piping as designated on the drawing and/or as specified herein. Detectors shall have sensitivity in the range of 4 to 10 gallons per minute and a static pressure rating of 450 psi for 2?-8? pipes. The flow condition must exist for a period of time necessary to overcome the selected retard period that is field adjustable. The delay mechanism shall be a sealed mechanical pneumatic unit with visual indication of actuation. The actuation mechanism shall include a polyethylene vane inserted through a hole in the pipe and connected by a mechanical linkage to the delay mechanism. Outputs shall consist of dual SPDT switches. Two conduit entrances for standard fittings of commonly used electrical conduit shall be provided on the detectors. (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/water-flow-switch.jpg", "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Water Flow Switch"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Certificate","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/90_certificate.pdf"},{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/90_catelogue.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "water", "flow", "switch" ] }, { "id": "ptel-zone-control-valve", "slug": "zone-control-valve", "name": "Zone Control Valve", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-protection-valves", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Zone Control Valve (as listed by source).", "description": "Zone Control Valve is a system designed to separate the area in case of maintenance and to get the indication of fire zone on a combination of Butterfly valve, Flow Switch, Pressure Gauge and Test & Drain Valves. Zone control valve (Floor control valve) is a combined unit of 4 parts: signal butterfly valve, water flow indicator, pressure gauge and test & drain valve. They are assembled on fire pipeline to separate the fire area into small distribution zone for indication and control. Because of fire sprinkler or test valve activation, the indicator detects water flow and transmits signal to control system. After fire suppression, the butterfly valve gets a signal, to indicate manual shutdown down the water flow to recover the system (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/zone-control-valve.jpg", "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Zone Control Valve"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/91_catelogue.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "zone", "control", "valve" ] }, { "id": "ptel-alarm-check-valve-assembly", "slug": "alarm-check-valve-assembly", "name": "Alarm Check Valve Assembly", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-protection-valves", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Alarm Check Valve Assembly (as listed by source).", "description": "The alarm check valve is�a water flow alarm device designed for vertical installation in the main supply to a wet pipe sprinkler system. When a flow of water from the system equals or exceeds that of a single sprinkler, the valve is to actuate a fire alarm (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/alarm-check-valve-assembly.jpg", "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Alarm Check Valve Assembly"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/92_catelogue.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "alarm", "check", "valve", "assembly" ] }, { "id": "ptel-pressure-gauge", "slug": "pressure-gauge", "name": "Pressure Gauge", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-protection-valves", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Pressure Gauge (as listed by source).", "description": "SD-P1 Pressure Gauge are specifically designed for Fire Sprinkler Services. The pressure gauge is UL Listed and FM approved. It has corrosion resistant polished stainless steel case and Bezel and Brass wetted parts. The dial has pressure reading in KG/SQCM and PSI. The gauge window is hardened glass. The pressure gauge must be mounted by square provided for spanner grip on the socket and not by turning the case. Turning of case will damage the gauge. Use PTFE tape around male threads of the gauge for sealing. Pressure gauge must be mounted in vertical position and isolated with valve or cock. The pressure gauge must be handled with due care for best results, the gauge should be stored in the original packing in which it has been shipped. It is advisable to ship the gauge in the same package for future transit. The pressure gauge, which is visibly damaged, should not be installed. It is recommended that the pressure gauges must be inspected regularly for possible corrosion or damage. The gauge must be periodically calibrated as per requirement or as per local authority having jurisdiction. (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/pressure-gauge.png", "specifications": [{"label":"DIAL SIZE","value":"90mm (3�\")"},{"label":"CONNECTION","value":"�\" BSPT (�\" NPT Optional)"},{"label":"RANGE","value":"0-21 Kg/Sq. CM & 0-300 PSI"},{"label":"BURDON TUBE & MOVEMENT","value":"Phosphorus Bronze Brudon tube and brass moving parts"},{"label":"DIAL TYPE","value":"White background, Black graduation scale with dual reading in KG/SQM. and PSI"},{"label":"CASE AND BAZEL","value":"Polished Stainless Steel Case Positive seal against weather moisture and dust."},{"label":"MOUNTING","value":"Direct"},{"label":"WINDOW","value":"Hardened Glass"},{"label":"ACCURACY","value":"� 2% of FSD for middle half of scale."},{"label":"WEIGHT (APPROX)","value":"0.3 Kg"},{"label":"REFERENCE STANDARD","value":"UL 393, NFPA-13"}], "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Pressure Gauge"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Certificate","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/6762a61b399d5_certificate_93.pdf"},{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/674ff57806538_catelogue_93.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "pressure", "gauge" ] }, { "id": "ptel-auto-air-vent", "slug": "auto-air-vent", "name": "Auto Air Vent", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-protection-valves", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Auto Air Vent (as listed by source).", "description": "According to NFPA Pumps that are automatically controlled shall be provided with a listed float-operated air release valve having a nominal 0.50 in. (12.7 mm) minimum diameter discharged to atmosphere. (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/auto-air-vent.png", "specifications": [{"label":"Sizes:","value":"�\", _\", 1\""},{"label":"Pressure Rating:","value":"175 psi"},{"label":"Body and Cover","value":"Ductile Iron ASTM A536 64-45-12"},{"label":"Float","value":"Stainless Steel 316, ASTM A240"},{"label":"Internal Parts","value":"Stainless Steel 316, ASTM A240"},{"label":"Orifice Button","value":"EPDM"},{"label":"Paint Specification","value":"Red Epoxy Painted"},{"label":"Operational Highlights","value":"\u0007 Releases unwanted air pockets during system operation"}], "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Auto Air Vent"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Certificate","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/94_certificate.pdf"},{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/67503c9be3f67_catelogue_94.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "auto", "air", "vent" ] }, { "id": "ptel-ball-valve", "slug": "ball-valve", "name": "Ball Valve", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-protection-valves", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Ball Valve (as listed by source).", "description": "A ball valve is a form of quarter-turn valve that uses a pivoting ball that has been drilled through to control flow. When the hole is in line with the flow direction, it allows fluids or gasses to pass through. Alternatively, when the ball is turned 90 degrees, the flow is stopped completely. In either case, the handle serves as a visual indicator of the valve's status. If the handle is parallel to the valve, it's open. In contrast, if the handle is perpendicular, the valve is closed. (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/ball-valve.png", "availability": "inquiry-required", "features": ["Ball Valve"], "applications": ["Fire protection systems (project-specific)"], "documents": [{"label":"Certificate","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/95_certificate.pdf"},{"label":"Catalogue","url":"https://ptel.com.bd/storage/product/95_catelogue.pdf"}], "keywords": [ "ball", "valve" ] }, { "id": "ptel-landing-valve", "slug": "landing-valve", "name": "Landing Valve", "category": "fire-protection-system", "subcategory": "fire-hydrant-accessories", "brand": "", "model": "", "shortDescription": "Landing Valve (as listed by source).", "description": "MODEL: NDR097KM Landing valve is an assembly comprising a valve and outlet connection from a wet or dry riser. It is considered as a core part of the hose system that works as a manual stop valve allowing you to completely control your firefighting system. We have three types of Landing Valve- 1. Flanged, 2. Thread, 3. Pressure Reducing. BSI Kitemark and LPCB certified Body material made of copper alloy to EN 1982 Hand wheel material made of grey cast iron to BS EN 1561 Blank cap material made of copper alloy to EN 1982 Possible to replace the gland seal when under pressure with the valve fully closed Disc facing rubber is of replaceable type Valves are provided with a strap and pad lock so that the hand wheel can be secured to counter unauthorized use The hand wheel is BLACK painted and body to RED NAFFCO pressure reducing oblique landing valves are suitable for installation on wet risers in buildings for fire fighting purposes, permanently charged with water from a pressurized supply. These landing valves are pressure reducing type designed to provide a range of outlet pressure (4 bar -12 bar). The Landing valves are classified under high pressure and are suitable for use at nomi (Source: source website; confirm suitability/approvals per project.)", "image": "https://ptel.com.b